  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine the rice and water, and soak for 30 minutes.",
    "In a large pot, heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil over medium heat, and cook the onions until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the pot, and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken breast to the pot, and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, cream of tartar, salt, and black pepper to the pot, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the soaked rice to the pot, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 10-15 minutes, or until the rice is tender and fluffy.",
    "While the rice is cooking, combine the lemon juice, grapes, and teriyaki sauce in a small bowl, and mix well.",
    "Once the rice is cooked, transfer it to a large terracotta dish, and drizzle with the lemon juice mixture.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with chopped parsley and a dollop of pomegranate molasses, if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
  ],
